
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Саня Иванов — помогите мне вернуться на ноги</title>
<meta name="description" content="Личная история и сбор помощи: компрессионный перелом позвоночника, грыжи шейного отдела, больные колени. Любая поддержка важна.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1210">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%20viewBox='0%200%20100%20100'%3E%3Ctext%20y='0.9em'%20font-size='90'%3E%F0%9F%92%9A%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<meta property="og:title" content="Саня Иванов — помогите мне вернуться на ноги">
<meta property="og:description" content="Компрессионный перелом позвоночника, грыжи шейного отдела, больные колени. Я собираю на обследование, лечение и реабилитацию.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0b1210; --bg2:#0e1714;
  --text:#e9f1ed; --muted:#9db3a9;
  --accent:#34d399; --accent2:#22d3ee;
  --card:rgba(255,255,255,.045); --stroke:rgba(255,255,255,.09);
  --radius:22px;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:92px}
body{
  background:var(--bg); color:var(--text);
  font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
  line-height:1.65; overflow-x:hidden;
}
body::after{
  content:""; position:fixed; inset:0; pointer-events:none; z-index:5; opacity:.05;
  background-image:url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='160' height='160'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.9' numOctaves='2'/><feColorMatrix type='saturate' values='0'/></filter><rect width='160' height='160' filter='url(%23n)' opacity='0.55'/></svg>");
}
.orb{position:fixed;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(70px);z-index:-1;opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}
.orb1{width:560px;height:560px;left:-160px;top:-160px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(52,211,153,.45),transparent 62%);animation:drift 26s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
.orb2{width:640px;height:640px;right:-220px;top:32%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(34,211,238,.30),transparent 62%);animation:drift 32s ease-in-out infinite alternate-reverse}
.orb3{width:420px;height:420px;left:8%;bottom:-160px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(251,191,36,.16),transparent 62%);animation:drift 38s ease-in-out infinite alternate}
@keyframes drift{from{transform:translate3d(0,0,0) scale(1)}to{transform:translate3d(60px,40px,0) scale(1.12)}}
.container{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
/* ---------- header ---------- */
header{
  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:50;
  background:rgba(11,18,16,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);
}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:68px}
.logo{font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em;font-size:1.06rem;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.logo-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(52,211,153,.8)}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:26px}
.nav-links a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:.92rem;transition:color .2s}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--text)}
/* ---------- buttons ---------- */
.btn{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;
  padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;
  text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;border:1px solid transparent;
  transition:transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease, background .18s ease, border-color .18s;
}
.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#34d399,#0ea5a0);color:#04120c;box-shadow:0 10px 30px -10px rgba(52,211,153,.55)}
.btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 16px 40px -12px rgba(52,211,153,.7)}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--text);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.2)}
.btn-ghost:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-sm{padding:10px 20px;font-size:.9rem}
/* ---------- hero ---------- */
.hero{padding:150px 0 70px;position:relative}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr .95fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}
.eyebrow{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);
  background:rgba(52,211,153,.08);border:1px solid rgba(52,211,153,.25);
  padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:22px;
}
.eyebrow .pulse{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);animation:pulse 2s infinite}
@keyframes pulse{0%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(52,211,153,.6)}70%{box-shadow:0 0 0 9px rgba(52,211,153,0)}100%{box-shadow:0 0 0 0 rgba(52,211,153,0)}}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5.2vw,3.7rem);line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:20px}
h1 .grad{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent}
.hero-sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.08rem;max-width:34rem;margin-bottom:32px}
.hero-actions{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.photo-wrap{perspective:1200px;position:relative}
.photo-glow{position:absolute;inset:-10%;background:radial-gradient(closest-side,rgba(52,211,153,.28),transparent 70%);filter:blur(30px);z-index:0;animation:breathe 6s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes breathe{0%,100%{opacity:.65;transform:scale(1)}50%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.05)}}
.photo-frame{
  position:relative;z-index:1;border-radius:26px;overflow:hidden;
  border:1px solid transparent;
  background:linear-gradient(#0d1512,#0d1512) padding-box,linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(52,211,153,.65),rgba(34,211,238,.4) 45%,rgba(255,255,255,.14)) border-box;
  box-shadow:0 34px 90px -24px rgba(0,0,0,.65), 0 0 70px -26px rgba(52,211,153,.45);
  transform-style:preserve-3d;transition:transform .25s ease-out;will-change:transform;
}
.photo-frame img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}
.photo-badge{
  position:absolute;top:16px;left:16px;z-index:2;
  background:rgba(8,14,12,.62);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:999px;
  padding:8px 16px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--text);
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
}
.photo-badge .pulse{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);animation:pulse 2s infinite}
.photo-caption{margin-top:14px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;text-align:center}
/* ---------- stats ---------- */
.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;padding:26px 0 10px}
.stat{
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:22px 26px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px);position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.stat::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(120deg,transparent 30%,rgba(255,255,255,.05) 50%,transparent 70%);transform:translateX(-100%);animation:shine 7s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes shine{0%,60%{transform:translateX(-100%)}100%{transform:translateX(100%)}}
.stat-value{font-size:1.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.stat-value.accent{color:var(--accent)}
.stat-label{color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;margin-top:2px}
.stat-hint{color:var(--muted);font-size:.78rem;margin-top:6px;opacity:.85}
/* ---------- sections ---------- */
section{padding:92px 0}
.section-head{margin-bottom:44px;max-width:44rem}
.section-head .eyebrow{margin-bottom:16px}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.4vw,2.4rem);letter-spacing:-.015em;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:14px}
.section-head p{color:var(--muted)}
/* ---------- story ---------- */
.story-text p{color:#cfdcd6;margin-bottom:18px;max-width:46rem}
.dx-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin:34px 0}
.dx{
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:var(--radius);
  padding:26px;backdrop-filter:blur(8px);transition:transform .25s ease,border-color .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease;
}
.dx:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:rgba(52,211,153,.35);box-shadow:0 20px 50px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.6)}
.dx-icon{
  width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  background:rgba(52,211,153,.12);border:1px solid rgba(52,211,153,.3);margin-bottom:16px;color:var(--accent);
}
.dx h3{font-size:1.08rem;margin-bottom:8px}
.dx p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem}
/* ---------- needs ---------- */
.needs-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}
.need{
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:24px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);transition:transform .25s ease,border-color .25s;
}
.need:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:rgba(34,211,238,.35)}
.need .num{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent2);letter-spacing:.14em}
.need h3{font-size:1.02rem;margin:10px 0 8px}
.need p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
/* ---------- progress ---------- */
.progress-card{
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(52,211,153,.10),rgba(255,255,255,.03) 45%);
  border:1px solid rgba(52,211,153,.22);border-radius:28px;padding:40px;backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
}
.progress-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px}
.progress-sum{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.6rem);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}
.progress-sum span{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:600}
.progress-pct{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}
.bar{height:16px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);overflow:hidden;position:relative}
.bar-fill{
  height:100%;width:0%;border-radius:999px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,#34d399,#22d3ee);
  transition:width 1.6s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1);
  box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(52,211,153,.55);
}
.bar-fill::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent 30%,rgba(255,255,255,.45) 50%,transparent 70%);transform:translateX(-100%);animation:shine 2.8s ease-in-out infinite}
.progress-note{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
/* ---------- help ---------- */
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.step{
  background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:30px;
  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.step-num{
  position:absolute;top:14px;right:20px;font-size:3.4rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1;
  color:rgba(255,255,255,.05);letter-spacing:-.04em;
}
.step h3{font-size:1.12rem}
.step p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.94rem;flex:1}
.req-box{
  border:1.5px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.22);border-radius:16px;padding:18px;
  color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);
}
.req-row{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:14px;
  padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:10px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;
}
.req-row .label{font-size:.75rem;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em}
.req-row .value{font-weight:700;font-size:.98rem;word-break:break-all}
.copy-btn{
  background:rgba(52,211,153,.12);border:1px solid rgba(52,211,153,.35);color:var(--accent);
  border-radius:10px;padding:8px 14px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;transition:background .2s;flex-shrink:0;
}
.copy-btn:hover{background:rgba(52,211,153,.22)}
/* ---------- blog / timeline ---------- */
.timeline{border-left:2px solid rgba(52,211,153,.3);margin-left:8px;padding-left:30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:34px}
.t-item{position:relative}
.t-item::before{
  content:"";position:absolute;left:-38px;top:6px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--bg);border:3px solid var(--accent);box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(52,211,153,.6);
}
.t-date{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--accent2);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}
.t-item h3{margin:8px 0 8px;font-size:1.15rem}
.t-item p{color:var(--muted);max-width:44rem}
/* ---------- footer ---------- */
footer{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.07);padding:44px 0;margin-top:40px}
.footer-grid{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
.footer-grid a{color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
.footer-grid a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
.ps{color:var(--muted);font-size:.88rem;max-width:30rem}
/* ---------- reveal / toast ---------- */
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(26px);transition:opacity .8s ease,transform .8s cubic-bezier(.22,1,.36,1)}
.reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
.toast{
  position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:30px;transform:translate(-50%,20px);z-index:100;
  background:rgba(10,18,15,.9);border:1px solid rgba(52,211,153,.4);color:var(--text);
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-radius:999px;padding:12px 24px;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:600;
  opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .3s,transform .3s;
}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,0)}
/* ---------- улучшения v2 ---------- */
::selection{background:rgba(52,211,153,.35);color:#fff}
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:var(--bg)}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:rgba(52,211,153,.35);border-radius:8px;border:2px solid var(--bg)}
.nav-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.btn-primary{position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.btn-primary::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(100deg,transparent 30%,rgba(255,255,255,.45) 50%,transparent 70%);transform:translateX(-130%);transition:transform .65s ease}
.btn-primary:hover::after{transform:translateX(130%)}
.hover-glow{position:relative}
.hover-glow::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;border-radius:inherit;opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(340px circle at var(--mx,50%) var(--my,50%),rgba(52,211,153,.16),transparent 65%)}
.hover-glow:hover::before{opacity:1}
.scroll-progress{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:-2px;height:2px}
.scroll-progress span{display:block;height:100%;width:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(52,211,153,.8)}
.burger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:none;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 10px;cursor:pointer}
.burger span{width:18px;height:2px;background:var(--text);border-radius:2px;transition:transform .3s,opacity .3s}
.burger.open span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(7px) rotate(45deg)}
.burger.open span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
.burger.open span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(-45deg)}
.mobile-menu{overflow:hidden;max-height:0;transition:max-height .45s ease;background:rgba(11,18,16,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--stroke)}
.mobile-menu.open{max-height:340px}
.mobile-menu a{display:block;padding:14px 24px;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.05)}
.mobile-menu a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
@media (min-width:721px){.mobile-menu{display:none}}
.ticker{overflow:hidden;border-top:1px solid var(--stroke);border-bottom:1px solid var(--stroke);background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);padding:13px 0;margin-top:34px}
.ticker-track{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:tick 30s linear infinite}
.ticker:hover .ticker-track{animation-play-state:paused}
.ticker-group{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:44px;padding-right:44px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}
.ticker-group i{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}
@keyframes tick{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}
.spark{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;filter:blur(.4px);animation:floaty 10s ease-in-out infinite}
@keyframes floaty{0%,100%{transform:translate3d(0,0,0);opacity:.25}50%{transform:translate3d(16px,-26px,0);opacity:.85}}
.s1{width:7px;height:7px;left:4%;top:24%;background:var(--accent)}
.s2{width:5px;height:5px;left:46%;top:12%;background:var(--accent2);animation-delay:-3s}
.s3{width:6px;height:6px;left:58%;top:70%;background:var(--accent);animation-delay:-5s}
.s4{width:4px;height:4px;left:12%;top:78%;background:var(--accent2);animation-delay:-7s}
.s5{width:5px;height:5px;left:88%;top:40%;background:#fbbf24;animation-delay:-2s}
.to-top{position:fixed;right:26px;bottom:26px;z-index:60;width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(52,211,153,.45);background:rgba(10,18,15,.82);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);color:var(--accent);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;cursor:pointer;opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px);pointer-events:none;transition:opacity .3s,transform .3s}
.to-top.show{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}
.to-top:hover{background:rgba(52,211,153,.16);transform:translateY(-3px)}
/* ---------- responsive ---------- */
@media (max-width:960px){
  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}
  .hero{padding-top:120px}
  .needs-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .steps{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .dx-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}
@media (max-width:720px){
  .nav-links{display:none}
  .burger{display:flex}
  .stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .needs-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .progress-card{padding:28px}
  section{padding:64px 0}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *,*::before,*::after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}
  html{scroll-behavior:auto}
  .reveal{opacity:1;transform:none}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="orb orb1"></div><div class="orb orb2"></div><div class="orb orb3"></div>

<header>
  <div class="container nav">
    <a class="logo" href="#top"><span class="logo-dot"></span>Саня Иванов</a>
    <nav class="nav-links">
      <a href="#story">История</a>
      <a href="#needs">На что сбор</a>
      <a href="#help">Как помочь</a>
      <a href="#blog">Дневник</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="#help">Помочь</a>
      <button class="burger" id="burger" type="button" aria-label="Открыть меню" aria-expanded="false"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobile-menu">
    <a href="#story">История</a>
    <a href="#needs">На что сбор</a>
    <a href="#help">Как помочь</a>
    <a href="#blog">Дневник</a>
    <a href="https://vk.ru/bibibi_boba" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Написать в VK</a>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-progress"><span id="scroll-progress"></span></div>
</header>

<main id="top">
  <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
  <div class="container hero">
    <span class="spark s1"></span><span class="spark s2"></span><span class="spark s3"></span><span class="spark s4"></span><span class="spark s5"></span>
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span>Сбор открыт</span>
        <h1>Помогите мне <span class="grad">вернуться на ноги</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Меня зовут Саня. Компрессионный перелом позвоночника, грыжи шейного отдела и колени, которые подводят на каждом шагу. Я собираю <strong id="hero-goal">300 000 ₽</strong> на обследование, лечение и реабилитацию — и буду честно рассказывать о каждом шаге пути.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#help">Поддержать</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" id="hero-vk" href="https://vk.ru/bibibi_boba" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Написать мне в VK</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="photo-wrap">
        <div class="photo-glow"></div>
        <figure class="photo-frame" data-tilt>
          <span class="photo-badge"><span class="pulse"></span>это я</span>
